@baseUrl = http://localhost:5210
@adminCookie = paste-admin-cookie-here
@requestVerificationToken = paste-token-from-upload-token-response-here

### Test Gemini directly without RAG search
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/gemini
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Test RAG chat; the only request field is message
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/assist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Trả lời ngắn gọn: Gemini có hoạt động không?"
}

### Get an antiforgery token before upload
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/querry/upload-token
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Upload a small sample document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/querry/upload
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}
RequestVerificationToken: {{requestVerificationToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AuirUploadBoundary

------AuirUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="swagger-check.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

AUIR Swagger upload verification sample document.
------AuirUploadBoundary--
